gama(){return"Stop departures \u2014 approximate"},
gam9(){return'\u2022 Departure times are NOT live bus positions (public sources don\'t publish real-time vehicle data yet). Time at a stop = scheduled departure from the first stop + estimated travel time to this stop (see "Riding time").\n\u2022 Most routes only publish a frequency (e.g. every 8\u201315 min), not per-trip times: the app shows "every ~N min" and never invents times. Only routes with fixed departures show a per-trip countdown.\n\u2022 The last trip at a stop is also an estimate: buses can pass a few minutes to 10+ minutes early or late in traffic. Get to the stop early, especially for the last bus.\n\u2022 When timetables change (new times, moved stops, discontinued routes), the data is re-fetched from the sources every week (Monday) \u2014 HCMC from the city bus information system (apicms.ebms.vn), Hanoi from timbus.vn (Transerco), metro from OpenStreetMap \u2014 and published openly at github.com/mittohoa/toidi-data. The app downloads new data automatically and tells you if routes you ride changed.\n\u2022 Ad-hoc notices (road closures, events, weather) are not in the data yet.'},
