ga1a(){return"To draw walking legs along real streets (instead of straight lines), work out the real walking distance to and from stops (so you're never told to walk across a river, canal or highway), and suggest walking or motorbike routes when buses stop, the app sends your start and destination points and the ends of walking legs (rounded to ~10 m, together with nearby stop locations) to the OSRM routing service run by FOSSGIS (Germany, OpenStreetMap data). No account or other information is sent.\n\nYou can change this anytime in Profile & settings."},
